The definitions quoted in the ontologies are taken from the standards each
pattern rests on: VDI/VDE 3682, ISO/IEC 7498-1, ISO/IEC 22989 and
IEC 60050-351. The standards themselves are copyright of their respective
issuing bodies and are not distributed here. Each element carries a skos:note
naming the clause it comes from, so a reader can go back to the source.
